    "detailed_description": "Ragdoll Rumble is a chaotic party game where toy wizards unleash wild spells in explosive spellcasting battles. Cast crazy abilities, outsmart your opponents, and prove to your friends that you are the dominant doll!<br><br><br><strong>Cast Spells, Cause Havoc!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/4e6ac42aa6fca7f20a4c28d870a447aa.poster.avif?t=1731626965\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/4e6ac42aa6fca7f20a4c28d870a447aa.webm?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/4e6ac42aa6fca7f20a4c28d870a447aa.mp4?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Wield an arsenal of zany spells to dash around, launch into the air, or blast your friends off the map. Search for Elixirs to unlock even more insane abilities\u2014like fireballs, swirling whirlpools, or lightning storms that make the battlefield dangerous and unpredictable.<br><br><br><strong>Local &amp; Remote Splitscreen Mayhem!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/d702fba3adedf51023aeb0a827512d49.poster.avif?t=1731626965\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/d702fba3adedf51023aeb0a827512d49.webm?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/d702fba3adedf51023aeb0a827512d49.mp4?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight against or alongside your friends in 2-4 player local splitscreen, or connect via Steam Remote Play to bring the chaos online. With a variety of maps and game modes, every match is fresh, unpredictable, and full of surprises\u2014like teleporters and boulder traps that shift the flow of battle.<br><br><br><strong>New Content Coming Soon!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/816bd8b1a15a8c3d29cfdd4d6241aacd.poster.avif?t=1731626965\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/816bd8b1a15a8c3d29cfdd4d6241aacd.webm?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059230/extras/816bd8b1a15a8c3d29cfdd4d6241aacd.mp4?t=1731626965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>More madness is on the way with upcoming game modes and maps! Keep an eye out for updates as the Rumble continues to evolve.<br><br>Get ready to rumble in Ragdoll Rumble, where the spell-slinging action never stops. Stay tuned for updates!",
